{"kbSeed":[{"id":"p-home","name":"Home","html":"<header class=\"kb-header\"><div class=\"kb-container\"><a class=\"kb-brand\" href=\"/\">Hearthside Community Trust</a><nav data-kb=\"menu\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a></nav></div></header><section class=\"kb-hero\"><div class=\"kb-container\"><span class=\"kb-eyebrow\">Registered charity</span><h1>Together, we make Yourtown kinder</h1><p class=\"kb-lead\">We run a food bank, a youth club and a befriending service for older neighbours, all powered by volunteers.</p><div class=\"kb-btns\"><a class=\"kb-btn\" href=\"/donate/\">Donate</a><a class=\"kb-btn kb-ghost\" href=\"/volunteer/\">Volunteer</a></div></div></section><section class=\"kb-section kb-dark\"><div class=\"kb-container\"><div class=\"kb-stats\"><div class=\"kb-stat\"><b>3,400</b><span>food parcels last year</span></div><div class=\"kb-stat\"><b>120</b><span>volunteers</span></div><div class=\"kb-stat\"><b>85</b><span>older people befriended</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"kb-section kb-soft\"><div class=\"kb-container\"><div class=\"kb-center\"><h2>What we do</h2></div><div class=\"kb-spacer\"></div><div class=\"kb-row\" style=\"--kb-cols:3\"><div class=\"kb-col\"><div class=\"kb-card\"><div class=\"kb-icon\">🥫</div><h3>Food bank</h3><p>Emergency food parcels, no questions asked.</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-col\"><div class=\"kb-card\"><div class=\"kb-icon\">🎯</div><h3>Youth club</h3><p>Safe, fun evenings for 11–16s.</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-col\"><div class=\"kb-card\"><div class=\"kb-icon\">☕</div><h3>Befriending</h3><p>Weekly visits and calls for isolated neighbours.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"kb-section kb-dark kb-center\"><div class=\"kb-container\"><h2>Every pound helps</h2><p class=\"kb-lead\">£10 provides a family food parcel.</p><div class=\"kb-btns\"><a class=\"kb-btn\" href=\"/donate/\">Donate today</a></div></div></section><footer class=\"kb-footer\"><div class=\"kb-container\"><div class=\"kb-ro